 "nodes": {
  "-164505294": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "You came again. You always come.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "673945928": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    640624835,
    -445166034,
    -1860973381,
    1335991267
   ],
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "What is the world like now? The real world. Outside of this forest. Outside of… all this.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1859588243": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Sometimes I wonder... If I was forgotten because time passed, or because I stopped being real to them.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1486619838": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "But you see me. And I feel real again. And I...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "224039749": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m back. The… uh… the veil was thinning. I had to chant at it. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "640624835": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 673945928,
   "children": [
    -1895553598
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "It’s loud. Fast. Full of lights and noise—but beautiful too.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-445166034": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 673945928,
   "children": [
    2053527113
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Well, we have cars and porn now. So things got pretty advanced.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1860973381": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 673945928,
   "children": [
    -2070498822
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "It’s messy. People pretend they’re happy. Most aren’t.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2070498822": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1860973381,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So nothing has changed. We’ve just gotten better at lying about it. Maybe the world isn’t so different after all.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2053527113": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -445166034,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Porn? I’ve heard whispers. Corrupted dreams leaking into this world… And cars? That sounds even more dangerous.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1895553598": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 640624835,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Lights… I remember stars, once. But yours move. Flash. Change colors. I want to see them. Even if they blind me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-193964287": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Can I ask you something? Something… small?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1335991267": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 673945928,
   "children": [
    -2070612399
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You’d love the internet. It’s like the spirit world, but with more cats",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2070612399": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1335991267,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Cats still exist? Oh, thank the Void. I used to feed one under the temple steps… Then again, maybe they never really left.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "551503781": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Nyxara",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Tch. I… I have to go. Something… urgent. Spirit stuff. Very sacred.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
